{"title":"River Shop","slug":"River_Shop","hero":{"file":"River_Shop.webp","width":400,"height":200},"pageid":2255,"revid":22161,"timestamp":"2026-08-25T11:45:53Z","lastEditor":"Neonstorm-Noscript","categories":["Locations","Stores"],"infobox":{"type":"Buildings","fields":[{"label":"NPC","value":"Lumi Laurence"},{"label":"Version Added","value":"v1.51.0"},{"label":"Date Added","value":"01/03/2024"}]},"sections":[{"id":"description","text":"Description"},{"id":"inventory","text":"Inventory"},{"id":"trivia","text":"Trivia"}],"body":"<p><br>\nThe <b>River Shop</b> is a store located in the <a href=\"__BASE__/wiki/River_Caves/\">River Caves</a>.\n</p>\n<h2 id=\"description\">Description</h2>\n<p>Rather than dealing directly in cash, the shopkeeper <a href=\"__BASE__/wiki/Lumi_Laurence/\">Lumi Laurence</a> deals in Lumite Credits. This currency is earned by bringing <b>raw</b> pieces of <a href=\"__BASE__/wiki/Lumite/\">Lumite</a> to the exchange station and talking to <a href=\"__BASE__/wiki/Lumi_Laurence/\">Lumi</a>, who will buy each piece of Lumite in exchange for 1 Lumite Credit.\n</p><p>Lumi sells items that are mostly related to improving the player's ability to harvest resources from the River Caves.\n</p><p>The River Shop is found by going in the River Cave and following the middle path upstream relative to the entrance from the main waterfall. Following the route will lead to a visible hidden entrance behind the waterfall with fluorescent clusters of Lumite crystals.\n</p><p>At the top of the desert cave, also reachable from the River Cave, in the water, there's a side cave that'll also lead directly into the River Shop.\n</p>\n<div id=\"gallery-0\" hash=\"ae5b3b6150bca1bc44a1b909c7c56fd2\" data-seq-no=\"0\"><div></div><div><div><div id=\"RiverShopTopEntrance1-png\"><span data-unresolved=\"1\"><noscript><span class=\"ok-media-placeholder\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Image not yet archived: RiverShopTopEntrance1.png\">RiverShopTopEntrance1.png</span></noscript><span role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Image not yet archived: RiverShopTopEntrance1.png\">RiverShopTopEntrance1.png</span></span></div></div></div><div><div><div id=\"RiverShopTopEntrance2-png\"><span data-unresolved=\"1\"><noscript><span class=\"ok-media-placeholder\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Image not yet archived: RiverShopTopEntrance2.png\">RiverShopTopEntrance2.png</span></noscript><span role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Image not yet archived: RiverShopTopEntrance2.png\">RiverShopTopEntrance2.png</span></span></div></div></div><div><div><div id=\"RiverShopTopEntrance3-png\"><span data-unresolved=\"1\"><noscript><span class=\"ok-media-placeholder\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Image not yet archived: RiverShopTopEntrance3.png\">RiverShopTopEntrance3.png</span></noscript><span role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Image not yet archived: RiverShopTopEntrance3.png\">RiverShopTopEntrance3.png</span></span></div></div></div></div>\n<h2 id=\"inventory\">Inventory</h2>\n<p>This table shows all items available at the store.\n</p>\n<div class=\"ok-tablewrap\"><table>\n<tbody><tr>\n<th>Name</th>\n<th>Picture</th>\n<th>Price\n</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"__BASE__/wiki/Refined_Scooba_Tank/\">Refined Scooba Tank</a>\n</td>\n<td><figure typeof=\"mw:File\"><span role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Media not yet archived: Refined Scooba Tank\">Refined Scooba Tank</span><figcaption></figcaption></figure>\n</td>\n<td>150 Lumite Credits\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"__BASE__/wiki/Night_Vision_Goggles/\">Night Vision Goggles</a>\n</td>\n<td><figure typeof=\"mw:File\"><span role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Media not yet archived: Night Vision Goggles\">Night Vision Goggles</span><figcaption></figcaption></figure>\n</td>\n<td>50 Lumite Credits\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"__BASE__/wiki/Flashlight/\">Flashlight</a>\n</td>\n<td><figure typeof=\"mw:File\"><span role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Media not yet archived: Flashlight unboxed\">Flashlight unboxed</span><figcaption></figcaption></figure>\n</td>\n<td>1 Lumite Credit\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"__BASE__/wiki/Sticky_bomb/\">Sticky Bomb</a>\n</td>\n<td><figure typeof=\"mw:File\"><span role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Media not yet archived: Sticky Bomb\">Sticky Bomb</span><figcaption></figcaption></figure>\n</td>\n<td>1 Lumite Credit\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"__BASE__/wiki/Moldai/\">Moldai</a>\n</td>\n<td><figure typeof=\"mw:File\"><span role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Media not yet archived: Moldai\">Moldai</span><figcaption></figcaption></figure>\n</td>\n<td>30 Lumite Credits\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"__BASE__/wiki/Gleam_Harvester/\">Gleam Harvester</a></td>\n<td><figure typeof=\"mw:File\"><span role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Media not yet archived: Gleam Harvester\">Gleam Harvester</span><figcaption></figcaption></figure></td>\n<td>200 Lumite Credits\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"__BASE__/wiki/Moldog/\">Moldog</a>\n</td>\n<td><figure typeof=\"mw:File\"><span role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Media not yet archived: Moldog\">Moldog</span><figcaption></figcaption></figure>\n</td>\n<td>10 Lumite Credits\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"__BASE__/wiki/Lumite_Lantern/\">Lumite Lantern</a>\n</td>\n<td><figure typeof=\"mw:File\"><span role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Media not yet archived: Lumite Lantern\">Lumite Lantern</span><figcaption></figcaption></figure>\n</td>\n<td>1 Lumite Credits\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"__BASE__/wiki/Unknown_Cavern/\">Unknown Cavern</a>\n</td>\n<td><figure typeof=\"mw:File\"><span role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Media not yet archived: Unknowncavern\">Unknowncavern</span><figcaption></figcaption></figure>\n</td>\n<td>75 Lumite Credits\n</td></tr></tbody></table></div>\n<h2 id=\"trivia\">Trivia</h2>\n<ul><li>There is a sliced kiwi fruit hidden behind the boxes in the Lumite exchange station but the reason is unknown, however a possible reason is due to a user known as Jamerboy88 having suggested kiwis for over half a year.</li>\n<li>New location for river shop: <a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" href=\"https://youtu.be/dwhm9B1mkBg\">https://youtu.be/dwhm9B1mkBg</a>, other images with it's location on the page were outdated.</li></ul>\n<figure typeof=\"mw:File/Thumb\"> \t<span role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Media not yet archived: Kiwi fruit.\">Kiwi fruit.</span> \t<noscript><span role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Media not yet archived: Kiwi fruit.\">Kiwi fruit.</span></noscript> \t<figcaption> \t\t \t\t\t<span data-unresolved=\"1\"><svg><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-info-small\"></use></svg></span> \t\t \t\t \t\t \t\t\t<p>Kiwi fruit.</p> \t\t \t</figcaption> </figure>\n<figure typeof=\"mw:File/Thumb\"> \t<span role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Media not yet archived: Kiwi bird committing cannibalism on a kiwi fruit.\">Kiwi bird committing cannibalism on a kiwi fruit.</span> \t<noscript><span role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Media not yet archived: Kiwi bird committing cannibalism on a kiwi fruit.\">Kiwi bird committing cannibalism on a kiwi fruit.</span></noscript> \t<figcaption> \t\t \t\t\t<span data-unresolved=\"1\"><svg><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-info-small\"></use></svg></span> \t\t \t\t \t\t \t\t\t<p>Kiwi bird committing cannibalism on a kiwi fruit.</p> \t\t \t</figcaption> </figure>"}
